**Root cause:** `export`/`import` for triggers is only in `alpha`/`beta` release tracks on this gcloud version — not in the stable/GA command group you're using.

**Fix — use the beta track (safe, read-only for the export step):**

```bash
gcloud beta builds triggers export careernavigator-backend-staging \
  --project=pg-ae-n-app-125609 \
  --region=me-central2 \
  --destination=trigger-backend.yaml
```

```bash
cat trigger-backend.yaml
```

Paste output. (If `beta` component isn't installed, gcloud will prompt to install it — accept, it's a standard Google-maintained component, no risk.)
